{"abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credentials:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Receiving"}]},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Presenting"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them in answer to an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"text":" request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iOS document provider (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"reader."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Mobile","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform, through three protocols: a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" whose keys never leave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"protection, and a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier"